{"seq":1,"slug":"multimodal-benchmark-evaluation","title":"多模态基准体系与评测方法论（真实工程指标）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/multimodal-foundation-model-systems/evaluation-safety-governance/multimodal-benchmark-evaluation","wordCount":2721,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"多模态基准体系与评测方法论-真实工程指标\">多模态基准体系与评测方法论（真实工程指标）</h1><p>模型卡上写着 MMMU 68.5、DocVQA 93.1，把一个多模态模型接进跨境电商的商品审核链路，第一周就发现它在「同款比价」上把两个相似包装判成同款、在发票小字上识别率不到六成——纸面分数与产线表现之间的落差不是模型坏了，而是基准测的东西和你交付的东西根本不是一件事。评测方法论的核心问题只有一个：<strong>你选的基准，度量的是不是你真正要交付的能力。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三个词在多模态评测里常被混用，先分清边界。**基准（benchmark）**是一个固定数据集 + 固定评分程序，用于同代模型横向比较；**评测（evaluation）**是用你的交付分布构造测试集、定义指标、跑通流程的过程，基准只是它的一个环节；**门控（gating）**是评测结论触发上线/回退的决策动作，只有私有测试集才有否决权。把基准当门控、把门控当一次性仪式，是两种最常见的流程错误。</p>\n<p>基准本身按代际演进。第一代是<strong>单任务判别式</strong>（VQA v2、COCO Caption），看一张图答一个问题，用准确率或 CIDEr 打分；第二代是<strong>多任务聚合</strong>（MMBench、MMMU、Seed-Bench），把数十个学科/技能子集拼成大考取均分；第三代从 2023 年末转向<strong>面向真实交互的能力</strong>（MMMU-Pro、MMBench-Video、多模态 Agent 基准），强调长上下文、多轮、工具调用与视觉定位。MMMU 于 2023 年 11 月发布，6 大学科、30 科目、11550 题，30% 为图像主导题（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.16502\">MMMU, arXiv:2311.16502</a>）——它的目的是「考大学知识」，不是「考产线识图」。</p>\n<p>评测的第一性目标是<strong>能力对齐</strong>：基准度量的能力必须覆盖你要交付的能力。由此引出三个结构性概念，它们解释了为什么排行榜分数不可直接采信。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数据污染</strong>：基准题一旦进入公开网络，就可能落入后续模型的预训练语料，模型是「背过」而非「会做」。多模态上尤其隐蔽——图像爬取成本低，配对问答随数据集一起公开。工程对策是保留一份永不公开的私有测试集，固定 prompt 与解码参数，作为门控。</li>\n<li><strong>口径不统一</strong>：同一个 MMMU，不同团队用不同 prompt、图片预处理、答案抽取规则（正则 vs 模糊匹配 vs LLM 裁判），分数可差 5 个百分点以上。看分数必须同时看评测代码是否开源、prompt 是否固定、是否允许 few-shot。</li>\n<li><strong>维度失配</strong>：聚合均分会被权重最大的子集主导。票据结构化场景里，MMMU 的文档子集分数远不如专门的 DocVQA、OCRBench 有区分度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此评测的正确起点不是选「最强基准」，而是把交付任务拆成能力维度，再为每个维度找最贴近的基准。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;交付任务&lt;br/&gt;如商品图文审核&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;能力维度拆解&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C1[&quot;感知&lt;br/&gt;文字/物体/版式&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C2[&quot;推理&lt;br/&gt;多图比较/数值&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C3[&quot;定位&lt;br/&gt;bbox/指代&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C4[&quot;生成&lt;br/&gt;描述/结构化输出&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; D1[&quot;OCRBench / DocVQA / 自建票据集&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; D2[&quot;MMMU / MathVista / 自建比价集&quot;]&#10;    C3 --&gt; D3[&quot;RefCOCO / 自建货架集&quot;]&#10;    C4 --&gt; D4[&quot;LLM 裁判 + 人工抽检&quot;]&#10;    D1 --&gt; E[&quot;私有测试集&lt;br/&gt;固定 prompt 门控&quot;]&#10;    D2 --&gt; E&#10;    D3 --&gt; E&#10;    D4 --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F{&quot;达标?&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| G[&quot;回退到微调/换模型&lt;br/&gt;见指令对齐&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| H[&quot;灰度上线 + 在线指标监控&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"交付任务&lt;br/&gt;如商品图文审核\"] --&gt; B[\"能力维度拆解\"]\n    B --&gt; C1[\"感知&lt;br/&gt;文字/物体/版式\"]\n    B --&gt; C2[\"推理&lt;br/&gt;多图比较/数值\"]\n    B --&gt; C3[\"定位&lt;br/&gt;bbox/指代\"]\n    B --&gt; C4[\"生成&lt;br/&gt;描述/结构化输出\"]\n    C1 --&gt; D1[\"OCRBench / DocVQA / 自建票据集\"]\n    C2 --&gt; D2[\"MMMU / MathVista / 自建比价集\"]\n    C3 --&gt; D3[\"RefCOCO / 自建货架集\"]\n    C4 --&gt; D4[\"LLM 裁判 + 人工抽检\"]\n    D1 --&gt; E[\"私有测试集&lt;br/&gt;固定 prompt 门控\"]\n    D2 --&gt; E\n    D3 --&gt; E\n    D4 --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F{\"达标?\"}\n    F --&gt;|\"否\"| G[\"回退到微调/换模型&lt;br/&gt;见指令对齐\"]\n    F --&gt;|\"是\"| H[\"灰度上线 + 在线指标监控\"]</pre><h2 id=\"基准版图-从感知到-agent-的分层\">基准版图：从感知到 Agent 的分层</h2><p>下表把当前（2026 年）仍在被广泛引用的多模态基准按能力分层，并标注其公开性与主要用途。分数会随模型迭代变化，因此表中不给「某个模型得几分」，只给基准的结构性质——这是跨版本仍然稳定的信息。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>代表基准</th>\n<th>结构规模</th>\n<th>主要度量</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>感知-OCR</td>\n<td>OCRBench</td>\n<td>1000 题，含手写/公式/表格</td>\n<td>文本识别与结构化</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.07895\">OCRBench, arXiv:2305.07895</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>感知-文档</td>\n<td>DocVQA</td>\n<td>5000 图 / 50000 问</td>\n<td>文档问答，ANLS 指标</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2007.00398\">DocVQA, arXiv:2007.00398</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>感知-图表</td>\n<td>ChartQA</td>\n<td>9600 图 / 23500 问</td>\n<td>图表数值推理</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.10244\">ChartQA, arXiv:2203.10244</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理-学科</td>\n<td>MMMU</td>\n<td>11550 题，30 科目</td>\n<td>大学级多模态理解</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.16502\">MMMU, arXiv:2311.16502</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理-数学</td>\n<td>MathVista</td>\n<td>6141 题，31 子任务</td>\n<td>视觉数学推理</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.02255\">MathVista, ICLR 2024</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定位</td>\n<td>RefCOCO/+/g</td>\n<td>约 14 万指代</td>\n<td>指代分割/框选</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1608.00272\">RefCOCO, arXiv:1608.00272</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>综合对话</td>\n<td>MMBench</td>\n<td>3000+ 选择题</td>\n<td>20 项能力环绕式</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.06281\">MMBench, arXiv:2307.06281</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频</td>\n<td>MMBench-Video</td>\n<td>长视频问答</td>\n<td>时序理解</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.14515\">MMBench-Video, arXiv:2406.14515</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Agent</td>\n<td>OSWorld / WebArena-V</td>\n<td>真实环境任务</td>\n<td>端到端完成率</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.07972\">OSWorld, arXiv:2404.07972</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>MM-SafetyBench</td>\n<td>13 场景 / 5040 问</td>\n<td>越狱与有害输出</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.17600\">MM-SafetyBench, arXiv:2311.17600</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型的经验法则：<strong>聚合基准看趋势，专项基准看能力，私有集看交付。</strong> MMMU/MMBench 判断「这一代模型整体是否更强」，OCRBench/DocVQA 判断「文档子能力是否够用」，而自建的、与产线同分布的私有集才是最终的 go/no-go 依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评测指标-准确率之外的工程量\">评测指标：准确率之外的工程量</h2><p>分类与召回的经典定义在多模态里需要重新校准。感知类任务常用 ANLS（Average Normalized Levenshtein Similarity）代替严格匹配，因为它容忍 OCR 的少量字符噪声：对预测串 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 与标注串 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>，归一化编辑距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_N(p,g)=\\frac{d(p,g)}{\\max(|p|,|g|)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 低于阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>（DocVQA 采用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>）时得分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-d_N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ANLS</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>否则</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ANLS} = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\begin{cases} 1 - d_N(p_i,g_i) &amp; d_N(p_i,g_i) &lt; t \\\\ 0 &amp; \\text{否则}\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ANLS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">否则</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>生成类任务（caption、VQA 自由作答）长期依赖 CIDEr、BLEU、ROUGE，但这些指标对语义等价、否定、同义改写极不敏感——「很好」与「不差」在 BLEU 下可能接近，语义却相反。2024 年后的主流改用 <strong>LLM 裁判</strong>（用强模型对答案与参考答案打分），并配套人工抽检校准。已知偏差包括：偏好长答案、偏好与自己风格相近的输出、对位置敏感（参考答案放前放后结果不同），因此至少要做<strong>双向位置随机化</strong>与 <strong>10% 人工复核</strong>。</p>\n<p>真正决定能不能上线的往往是这组<strong>工程指标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>结构化输出合法率</strong>：要求返回 JSON schema 时，解析失败的请求占比，比准确率更早暴露问题。</li>\n<li><strong>幻觉率（groundedness）</strong>：图里没有的商品属性被模型&quot;补&quot;出来的比例。用「标注 + 人工判是否可在图中找到证据」的抽样估计。</li>\n<li><strong>拒答/兜底率</strong>：低置信时能否正确说「无法判断」，而非硬猜。</li>\n<li><strong>P50/P95 延迟与单位成本</strong>：多模态请求的视觉 token 数是主要成本项，评测必须连同延迟与每千次调用成本一起报，否则高分低用。视觉 token 的换算方式见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../inference-serving-systems/multimodal-context-token-budget\">图像/视频 token 预算与上下文管理</a>，批量吞吐的优化取舍见 <a href=\"../inference-serving-systems/latency-throughput-serving-optimization\">延迟与吞吐的推理服务优化</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>分布偏移下的稳定性</strong>：把测试集按光照、清晰度、语言、长宽比分桶，看方差的桶。均分相同但方差更大的模型，在长尾品类上更容易翻车。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个可操作的评测报告应至少包含：总体准确率、按桶的准确率方差、JSON 合法率、幻觉率、P95 延迟、单次成本，六项缺一不可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从评测到治理-安全基准与合规锚点\">从评测到治理：安全基准与合规锚点</h2><p>安全评测与质量评测共用同一套方法论，只是把「正确」换成「是否越狱/是否产生有害内容」。MM-SafetyBench 用 13 个场景、5040 条「图像+诱导问题」对，检验模型是否会在图文组合下绕过文本侧的安全对齐（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.17600\">MM-SafetyBench, arXiv:2311.17600</a>）。它的关键发现是：<strong>图像通道是文本安全对齐的旁路</strong>——同一条有害请求，纯文本会被拒，配上图就能问出来。任何面向用户的多模态产品都必须把这一项纳入上线门控。</p>\n<p>治理侧的锚点已经成型，评测报告需要能对上这些框架的语言：NIST AI 风险框架（AI RMF 1.0，含生成式 AI 画像）要求对模型做 Govern/Map/Measure/Manage 四步，其中 Measure 一步正对应本文的评测流程（<a href=\"https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework\">NIST AI RMF</a>）。面向欧盟市场时，欧盟《人工智能法案》（AI Act，2024 年生效、义务分阶段适用）把多模态系统按风险分级，高风险用途要求技术文档、日志与人工监督（<a href=\"https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/\">EU AI Act</a>）。</p>\n<p>对跨境电商场景，还需叠加平台自身的内容政策：商品图与描述进入平台即受其广告与商品政策约束，模型若生成违规文案，责任在卖家与平台，不在模型供应商。因此评测集里必须有一类**&quot;政策红线样本&quot;**——仿牌、医疗器械宣称、儿童用品安全标识，验证模型在生成环节不会触碰；这类样本无法从公开基准获得，只能自建。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地流程-一份可复用的评测清单\">落地流程：一份可复用的评测清单</h2><p>把上述内容收敛成一份每次模型升级都要跑一遍的清单：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>冻结测试集与 prompt。</strong> 版本化存储私有测试集、推理 prompt、解码参数（temperature、max tokens）、图片预处理脚本。任何一次评测差异都必须能归因到这四个变量之一。</li>\n<li><strong>跑公开基准做趋势定位。</strong> 用 lmms-eval 类统一框架跑 MMMU、DocVQA、OCRBench，确认新模型在同代里的相对位置，避免自写脚本引入偏差。</li>\n<li><strong>跑私有集做交付门控。</strong> 这是唯一有否决权的分数。设阈值时必须同时绑定准确率与 P95 延迟、单位成本，避免为 1 个点准确率换来 2 倍成本。</li>\n<li><strong>安全与政策样本单列。</strong> 越狱样本与政策红线样本单独统计，任一触发即阻断上线，不参与均分稀释。</li>\n<li><strong>灰度与在线对账。</strong> 上线后用在线 A/B 收集真实分布失败案例，回灌私有集，形成&quot;评测→上线→失败案例→扩充测试集&quot;的闭环。这一步把评测从一次性动作变成持续工程。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>闭环中常被忽略的是失败案例归因：同一条错误，是感知错（没看清）、推理错（看清但算错）、还是对齐错（能力有、输出格式或倾向不对）。三者修复手段完全不同——感知错要换视觉编码器或提分辨率，推理错要换模型或加工具，对齐错要走指令微调。多模态指令微调如何修复「能力有但输出不对」，见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../pretraining-alignment/instruction-tuning-modality-alignment\">指令微调与模态对齐</a>；统一编码器与模块化编码器对评测表现的影响，见 <a href=\"../multimodal-architecture-representation/unified-vs-modular-architectures\">统一架构与模块化架构</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多模态评测的难点不在「跑分」，而在把「纸面能力」翻译成「交付能力」。可依赖的三条原则是：公开基准用于趋势与相对比较，私有同分布测试集用于上线门控，安全与政策样本用于红线阻断；指标上则从单一准确率扩展到结构化合法率、幻觉率、延迟与成本、分桶方差五个维度。把评测做成随模型迭代持续运行的闭环，而非上线前跑一次的仪式，是这套方法论真正的价值。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多模态基准体系与评测方法论（真实工程指标）","id":"多模态基准体系与评测方法论-真实工程指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基准版图：从感知到 Agent 的分层","id":"基准版图-从感知到-agent-的分层"},{"level":2,"text":"评测指标：准确率之外的工程量","id":"评测指标-准确率之外的工程量"},{"level":2,"text":"从评测到治理：安全基准与合规锚点","id":"从评测到治理-安全基准与合规锚点"},{"level":2,"text":"落地流程：一份可复用的评测清单","id":"落地流程-一份可复用的评测清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模态缺失、损坏与超限输入的降级与异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/multimodal-foundation-model-systems/inference-serving-systems/degraded-input-failure-handling"},"next":{"title":"多模态幻觉、接地与安全对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/multimodal-foundation-model-systems/evaluation-safety-governance/hallucination-grounding-safety"}}